    },
    {
      "displayText": "The problem, you see, is that I can’t get a hot\nenough flame in my kitchen.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nLitleo here provides our firepower, but it can’t\nburn at max heat until it lets loose in battle!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĻ",
